    { question: "What impact will Bee have on the tech industry?", answer: "Bee is expected to accelerate innovation in consumer AI hardware, intensify competition among tech giants (Amazon, Apple, Google), increase demand for AI chip technologies, and prompt new discussions around AI ethics and regulation." }
