    featuredImagePrompt: "A conceptual visual representing the 'Oscars 2026.' Envision a shimmering, ethereal golden statuette as the central element, radiating a soft, warm light. Surrounding it, abstract, dreamlike elements evoke 'Old Hollywood Glamour' – think subtle art deco patterns, flowing drapery in deep velvet or silk textures, and hints of vintage film reels or spotlight beams, all in a sophisticated color palette of gold, deep red, and midnight blue. The composition should convey both prestige and anticipation, with a slightly abstract, artistic interpretation rather than a literal scene. Focus on elegant forms and symbolic representation. High resolution, cinematic lighting, conceptual art style.",
