    featuredImagePrompt: "A highly stylized and conceptual visual representing interconnected global geopolitical conflicts and economic fallout. The image features a dark, serious color palette with subtle glows. In the foreground, abstract representations of rising crude oil derricks are linked by subtle, glowing lines to a volatile, upward-trending stock market graph, with the Indian Rupee symbol subtly integrated into the peaks. In the background, a fragmented, futuristic map of the world highlights the Middle East (Iran, Israel) and East Africa (Ethiopia, Eritrea) with pulsating red and orange zones, symbolizing conflict hotspots. Faint outlines of critical shipping lanes (Strait of Hormuz, Red Sea) are subtly visible, hinting at supply chain disruptions. The overall composition is dynamic, suggesting tension and uncertainty, blending elements of finance, geopolitics, and energy, optimized for Google Discover uniqueness and standing out from typical news imagery.",
