    featuredImagePrompt: "A wide-angle, panoramic scene of a vibrant, packed modern sports stadium at dusk. On one side of the stadium, a giant screen displays a dramatic, action-shot from an NFL game (Bills vs. Rams), capturing an intense moment of athleticism. On the opposite side, overlaid subtly or projected onto another part of the stadium structure, are abstract, swirling graphic elements in dark, muted tones symbolizing controversy, legal documents, and blurred figures, representing the ongoing football scandals (Man City, Man Utd, Eom). The overall scene should convey both the excitement of live sports and the underlying tension of off-field drama. The lighting should emphasize the contrast between the bright, dynamic match action and the somber, complex issues. Focus on a realistic environment, capturing the energy of the crowd.",
