    featuredImagePrompt: "A visually striking conceptual image depicting global economic instability. Focus on a fractured world map or interconnected globe, with bond yield graphs sharply spiking upwards in a chaotic, 'disorderly' manner. Incorporate subtle elements representing high debt levels (e.g., heavy chains or weights) and inflation (e.g., rising prices indicated by abstract energy). The overall mood should be urgent and foreboding but not overly dramatic. Use a color palette of deep blues, grays, and oranges for emphasis on critical points. The composition should suggest interconnectedness and fragility, perhaps with fault lines or fissures running through the economic landscape. Include a faint, stylized representation of the IMF logo or a financial institution symbol in the background, subtly indicating the source of the warning. High detail, digital art.",
