    featuredImagePrompt: "A conceptual visual representing the Indian stock market and digital payments. On one side, a stylized depiction of stock market graphs (Sensex/Nifty) with arrows indicating both upward and downward trends, suggesting volatility. On the other side, a vibrant, flowing abstract representation of digital transaction data or UPI payments, perhaps with subtle rupee symbols and smartphone icons. A central element conceptually links these two, perhaps a subtle 'bridge' or 'connection point' signifying policy impact. Use a warm, energetic color palette typical of Indian festivals for the digital payment side, contrasting with more analytical tones for the market graphs. Avoid literal depictions of people or specific company logos. Focus on the interplay of finance and digital policy.",
