    featuredImagePrompt: "An editorial news layout showcasing a split screen. On one side, a stylized map of West Asia with faint red conflict zones, overlaid with an image of a US military drone or jet. On the other side, a stylized map of South America focusing on Venezuela with a subtle indicator of military activity. In the background, a silhouette of a stock market ticker with downward-trending arrows and an Indian flag motif. The overall style is urgent, modern news aesthetic with a muted color palette (blues, greys, subtle reds) to convey tension without sensationalism. No specific faces or identifiable individuals. Focus on geopolitical symbols and economic indicators.",
