      bearCase: "The Ledger security incident highlights persistent and significant security vulnerabilities within the crypto ecosystem, particularly concerning third-party risks. Such breaches erode user trust and can lead to substantial financial losses, potentially deterring new investors. Additionally, ongoing regulatory uncertainty, as seen with the CFTC\'s stance on prediction markets, creates an unpredictable environment that can stifle innovation and limit market access, ultimately hindering overall growth.",
