    risks: ["Prolonged private status delays liquidity for early investors and employees.", "Future public market conditions may still be volatile when Motive eventually seeks an IPO.", "Intense competition in the AI and fleet management sectors.", "Execution risks associated with aggressive growth and capital deployment.", "Potential for investor fatigue if private funding rounds become too frequent or valuations become stretched."],
